 bios/segacd.c  | 63 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 bios/segacd.h  |  2 ++
 bios/segacd2.S | 63 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 140 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

